# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository AND in working trees,
# regardless of the committer's platform. npm pack reads the working tree:
# CRLF drift there makes published tarballs differ byte-for-byte from a
# `git archive` of the same tag (reproducible-pack hygiene).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
